1044
00:40:00,373 --> 00:40:01,473
Gosh.

1045
00:40:02,043 --> 00:40:03,142
It looks tasty.

1046
00:40:03,143 --> 00:40:05,183
(He adds a smoky flavor for Jae Suk and Jun Haeng.)

1047
00:40:06,013 --> 00:40:07,283
It looks so tasty.

1048
00:40:07,853 --> 00:40:09,753
