1053
00:40:18,123 --> 00:40:19,993
- We'll eat it anyway. - That's right.

1054
00:40:21,493 --> 00:40:23,803
I added bigfin reef squid pieces like that.

1055
00:40:24,403 --> 00:40:26,703
- It's expensive. - It's really expensive.

1056
00:40:27,003 --> 00:40:29,172
