When you eat a bigfin reef squid, it tastes like...

1059
00:40:33,343 --> 00:40:34,823
- it contains butter. - That's right.

1060
00:40:35,713 --> 00:40:37,713
You feel like you're chewing butter.

1061
00:40:37,883 --> 00:40:40,003
The buttery flavors come out when you chew the squid.

1062
00:40:40,483 --> 00:40:41,812
