1063
00:40:41,813 --> 00:40:43,733
(The detailed description makes him feel dizzy.)

1064
00:40:44,883 --> 00:40:45,883
(Jang Woo coats the bigfin reef squid in red.)

1065
00:40:45,884 --> 00:40:47,023
It looks so tasty.

1066
00:40:48,193 --> 00:40:49,352
It smells amazing.

1067
00:40:49,353 --> 00:40:51,273
