1074
00:41:00,233 --> 00:41:01,703
Oh, my.

1075
00:41:02,003 --> 00:41:03,703
Gosh, you're no joke.

1076
00:41:05,043 --> 00:41:06,142
- He's really good. - Right?

1077
00:41:06,143 --> 00:41:08,119
It's really hard to do that with a wok. That's heavy.

1078
00:41:08,143 --> 00:41:09,443
(Impressed)

1079
00:41:10,183 --> 00:41:12,713
(He pours chunjang over the half-cooked squid.)

1080
00:41:13,953 --> 00:41:16,623
