1099
00:42:00,293 --> 00:42:01,663
Exactly.

1100
00:42:02,093 --> 00:42:04,563
- The bigfin reef squid is... - It's amazing.

1101
00:42:04,803 --> 00:42:06,403
Really? I should give it a try.

1102
