1134
00:43:16,743 --> 00:43:17,743
The octopus.

1135
00:43:17,744 --> 00:43:19,773
Gosh, it looks so tender.

1136
00:43:20,473 --> 00:43:22,313
It does look really tender. Gosh!

1137
00:43:22,373 --> 00:43:23,443
It will be really good.

1138
