1248
00:47:06,437 --> 00:47:07,766
- It tastes sour. - freshly squeezed milk...

1249
00:47:07,767 --> 00:47:09,107
as it wasn't sterilized.

1250
00:47:09,367 --> 00:47:11,106
I got a bit too ambitious and got ahead of myself.

1251
00:47:11,107 --> 00:47:12,377
