2141
01:19:36,692 --> 01:19:38,362
(Eating)

2142
01:19:39,362 --> 01:19:41,322
(Impressed)

2143
01:19:42,192 --> 01:19:43,792
Californian prunes are delicious.

2144
01:19:45,732 --> 01:19:47,102
I must have this for my bones.

2145
01:19:50,332 --> 01:19:52,901
