2146
01:19:52,902 --> 01:19:54,842
- I heard prunes were really good. - Really?

2147
01:19:54,912 --> 01:19:55,971
Prunes are really good for your gut.

2148
01:19:55,972 --> 01:19:57,012
Prunes are?

2149
