They're good for your bones and your bowel movement.

2150
01:19:59,282 --> 01:20:01,342
It's good in many ways.

2151
01:20:02,482 --> 01:20:03,612
Gosh, in summer,

2152
01:20:04,712 --> 01:20:05,852
