2162
01:20:25,102 --> 01:20:26,241
This is a sticker.

2163
01:20:26,242 --> 01:20:28,242
(Hold on, babies. I'll make friends for you guys.)

2164
01:20:29,772 --> 01:20:31,682
Here. This is from the Paleozoic era.

2165
01:20:32,382 --> 01:20:33,542
The Mesozoic era.

2166
01:20:34,382 --> 01:20:35,452
The Cenozoic era.

2167
01:20:36,582 --> 01:20:38,151
Yes. That way, you remember them.

2168
01:20:38,152 --> 01:20:39,152
Because you forget.

2169
01:20:39,153 --> 01:20:40,652
I think history is fun.

2170
01:20:40,822 --> 01:20:42,421
You really are quite romantic.

2171
01:20:42,422 --> 01:20:43,921
- Yes, he is romantic. - Thank you.

2172
01:20:43,922 --> 01:20:45,222
