It has all the dinosaurs I like.

2174
01:20:48,092 --> 01:20:50,262
- That's cute. - Stegosaurus.

2175
01:20:51,232 --> 01:20:52,832
Stegosaurus.

2176
01:20:53,432 --> 01:20:54,802
