2177
01:20:55,032 --> 01:20:56,572
Pachycephalosaurus.

2178
01:20:56,802 --> 01:20:59,272
Its forehead is 23cm thick.

2179
01:21:00,502 --> 01:21:02,672
I'm a human, and I'm living now.

2180
01:21:03,072 --> 01:21:05,281
So, it's a combination...

2181
01:21:05,282 --> 01:21:06,922
