2182
01:21:08,012 --> 01:21:09,152
It's the Ceno-Mesozoic era.

2183
01:21:09,912 --> 01:21:11,982
My house is like Jurassic Park.

2184
01:21:13,452 --> 01:21:15,451
My house is like the museum of natural history.

2185
01:21:15,452 --> 01:21:16,552
I have everything.

2186
01:21:17,522 --> 01:21:18,792
It looks like a home with kids.

2187
