Oh, the poster.

2188
01:21:20,622 --> 01:21:22,192
It suddenly became a home for kids.

2189
01:21:22,332 --> 01:21:24,431
Right. With a poster, it felt like that.

2190
01:21:24,432 --> 01:21:25,601
Right? It looks like a home with kids.

2191
01:21:25,602 --> 01:21:27,631
- Try sticking a Hangeul poster too. - Right.

2192
01:21:27,632 --> 01:21:28,771
Or an English alphabet poster.

2193
01:21:28,772 --> 01:21:30,571
- You could also... - For you to study.

2194
01:21:30,572 --> 01:21:32,071
Stick the giraffe height chart that measures your height.

2195
01:21:32,072 --> 01:21:33,301
- The giraffe height chart? - And the Hangeul poster.

2196
01:21:33,302 --> 01:21:35,641
Grown-ups can like the things that kids like.

2197
01:21:35,642 --> 01:21:37,241
- That's right. - Yes, you're right,

2198
01:21:37,242 --> 01:21:38,781
but it really looks like a home with kids with that.

2199
01:21:38,782 --> 01:21:39,782
The poster alone...

2200
01:21:39,783 --> 01:21:41,358
- changes the mood drastically. - It had such an effect.

2201
01:21:41,382 --> 01:21:42,952
Your home feels warmer.

2202
01:21:45,022 --> 01:21:47,021
(Hitting)

2203
