2212
01:22:08,712 --> 01:22:10,271
It does look fun.

2213
01:22:10,272 --> 01:22:11,442
It must be fun to dig.

2214
01:22:12,542 --> 01:22:13,712
I got the hand.

2215
01:22:14,912 --> 01:22:16,581
- I got the hand. - Kids must love this.

2216
01:22:16,582 --> 01:22:17,851
- They would. - They'd love this.

2217
01:22:17,852 --> 01:22:18,881
They'd go crazy for it.

2218
01:22:18,882 --> 01:22:20,382
