2224
01:22:31,092 --> 01:22:33,831
I think it'd be nice to play with when you have worries.

2225
01:22:33,832 --> 01:22:34,902
That's right.

2226
01:22:35,632 --> 01:22:37,601
Next time, I want to go to Haenam or Goseong.

2227
01:22:37,602 --> 01:22:38,741
There, you can see...

2228
01:22:38,742 --> 01:22:41,041
